<title>HONG KONG: Kookmin Bank to set US$200 mln sub FRN.</title>
<headline>Kookmin Bank to set US$200 mln sub FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kookmin Bank's upcoming US$200 million subordinated floating rate notes issue will be launched on December 16, lead manager Chase Manhattan Asia said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The notes have a maturity of 10 years with a call option in year five.</p>
<p>The issue price is at par to float at 60 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate for year one to five and 185 basis points over LIBOR thereafter.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch Far East is the other lead manager.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
